    "description": "The thrill of the casino, the rush of the sportsbook, and much more\u2014it\u2019s all just a click away with the BetRivers Casino & Sportsbook app. Join today and experience one of the best gaming apps in North America, operated by Rush Street Interactive\u2014winners of Customer Service Operator of the Year at the EGR North America Awards in April 2023.\r\n\r\nCombining transparency and trustworthiness with our best-in-class roster of casino games, sports betting odds, live sports streaming, and more, discover why BetRivers is the player-first casino and sportsbook app. \r\n\r\nCheck out our:\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Huge library of online casino games, like slots, blackjack, and roulette \r\n\u2714\ufe0f Wide variety of sports betting options\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Player-friendly bonusing and loyalty programs, including our industry-best 1x bonus playthrough requirement\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Flexible deposit methods\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Speedy & automated cash-out approvals. More than 75% of withdrawal requests are instantly approved!\r\n\u2714\ufe0f User-friendly responsible gaming tools, including deposit, spend and time limits, as well as ability to self-suspend or self-exclude.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Regular surprise and delight rewards in our ever-popular King Cash Community Chat! \r\n\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t wait, download the FREE BetRivers app and create your mobile account today! \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb0   <b>Online Casino Games Galore</b>\r\n\r\nBetRivers Online Casino offers more ways for players to win, including awarding free play through a wide range of fun bonus features we\u2019ve built exclusively for you. You'll experience wheel spins prizes, scratch cards, free bingo games, and more.\r\n\r\nIn our online casino, you\u2019ll find a wide selection of exciting table games, including <b>blackjack</b>, roulette, baccarat, and video poker, available to play individually or with a live dealer! \r\n\r\nYou\u2019ll also find the hottest <b>real-money slots</b>, from penny games to high-stakes progressive slots! It\u2019s no wonder our customers return to our online casino again and again.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6  <b>A Unique Sports Betting Experience</b>\r\n\r\nYou can wager on games 24/7 at BetRivers using our sports betting app or the website. \r\nChoose from moneylines, parlays, props, totals, futures and more. Just as exciting, you can even bet live on games as the action takes place. And don\u2019t miss our odds boosts, which provide even more value for every dollar you wager.\r\n\r\nYou can bet on:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc8 Football \u2013 NCAA odds & NFL betting, props, and futures\r\n\u26be Baseball \u2013 MLB and college baseball betting\r\n\ud83c\udfc0 Basketball \u2013 NBA & college games and futures\r\n\ud83c\udfbe Tennis \u2013 All current APT & WTA tennis odds\r\n\u26f3 PGA golf \u2013 PGA and LIV golf betting\r\n\u26bd Soccer -- Including Premier League, La Liga, and more\r\n\ud83c\udfc1 NASCAR and Formula auto racing\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Plus, MMA & UFC, NHL hockey, boxing and more!\r\n\r\n<b>iRush Rewards Loyalty Program for Casino & Sportsbook<b>\r\n\r\nEarn Bonus Store Points with every real money sports wager or casino game bet. You have full control of how you redeem those points for rewards.\r\n\r\nMust be 21+. Must be physically present in NJ, PA, IL, WV, AZ, CO, IA, LA, IN, VA, MI, MD and NY. Void where prohibited. T&C Apply.\r\n\r\nGAMBLING PROBLEM? (NJ, PA, IL and WV) If you or someone you know has a gambling problem, help is available. Call 1-800-GAMBLER (1-800-426-2537) or visit https://www.ncpgambling.org/; (AZ) Call 1.800.NEXTSTEP *or text \u201cNEXT-STEP\u201d to 53342. Ayuda para problemas con el juego: llame 1.800.NEXTSTEP o env\u00ede SMS \u201cNEXT-STEP\u201d al 53342; (CO) Call 1-800-522-4700; (IA) Call 1-800-BETS-OFF (1-800-238-7633); (LA) CALL 1-800-GAMBLER Offered in partnership with Bossier Casino Venture, Inc. d/b/a Margaritaville Resort Casino; (IN) Call 1-800-9-WITH-IT (1-800-994-8448); (VA) Call 1-888-532-3500. Presented by Rivers Casino Portsmouth; (MI) Call the Michigan Department of Health and Human Services Gambling Disorder Helpline at: 800-270-7117; (WV) or visit www.1800GAMBLER.net; (PA) Sportsbook licensing issued through Rivers Casino Pittsburgh; (MD) Please play responsibly. For help, visit http://mdgamblinghelp.org or call 1-800-GAMBLER; (NY) Call (877-8-HOPENY) or text HOPENY (467369).</b></b>",
